Happy Birthday Nate
===================

This is a simple interactive birthday greeting page made with HTML, CSS,
and JavaScript. It includes a birthday cake, a visible candle flame,
an interactive "Blow the candle" button, a candle extinguishing animation,
and a confetti celebration effect.

Project files
-------------

- index.html - The main page structure and birthday message.
- style.css - The page layout, cake illustration, candle, flame, animations,
  colors, and responsive styles.
- script.js - The candle-blowing interaction and confetti effect.

How to run
-----------

1. Open the BIRTHDAY folder.
2. Double-click index.html, or open it in a web browser.
3. Click "Blow the candle" to start the celebration.

Technologies
------------

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

